[stderr] question-card grammar and four named QB-A editorial batches with sources and
[stderr] reviews; adjudication/fairness and anti-repeat rules; First Whistle, Mixed
[stderr] Fixture, score/streak/results rules; guided accessibility, recovery/offline,
[stderr] and target parity. G tasks must create/review detailed bibles, not code and not
